    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin seamlessly integrates predefined Gutenberg blocks into your website, streamlining the process of creating and managing dynamic content. With its powerful features, Easy Block – ACF Pro Addon enhances your Gutenberg editing experience by enabling the use of custom, ready-to-use blocks tailored to your needs.</p>\n<p>To utilize the full capabilities of Easy Block – ACF Pro Addon, it is essential to have Advanced Custom Fields Pro version 6.0 or higher activated on your website. This dependency ensures compatibility and unlocks the advanced functionality needed to create highly customizable and flexible content layouts with ease.</p>\n<h4>Available blocks</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Hero Banner</li>\n<li>Auto Popup</li>\n<li>Carousel Slider</li>\n<li>Accordion</li>\n<li>Countdown</li>\n<li>Action Popup</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>New blocks are coming soon&#8230;</h4>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Action popup.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.9</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added detail description.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.8</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added an option to adjust the slider size for mobile devices.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.7</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Requires plugins update.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security fixes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Requires Plugins header.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Carousel Slider block.</li>\n<li>Added Accordion block.</li>\n<li>Added Countdown block.</li>\n<li>Block preview added</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Added Hero banner block.</li>\n<li>Modified block icons.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Security update, Slug update.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial version.</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "This plugin seamlessly integrates predefined Gutenberg blocks into your website, requiring the ACF Pro plugin.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin seamlessly integrates predefined Gutenberg blocks into your website, streamlining the process of creating and managing dynamic content. With its powerful features, Easy Block – ACF Pro Addon enhances your Gutenberg editing experience by enabling the use of custom, ready-to-use blocks tailored to your needs.</p>\n<p>To utilize the full capabilities of Easy Block – ACF Pro Addon, it is essential to have Advanced Custom Fields Pro version 6.0 or higher activated on your website. This dependency ensures compatibility and unlocks the advanced functionality needed to create highly customizable and flexible content layouts with ease.</p>\n<h4>Available blocks</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Hero Banner</li>\n<li>Auto Popup</li>\n<li>Carousel Slider</li>\n<li>Accordion</li>\n<li>Countdown</li>\n<li>Action Popup</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>New blocks are coming soon&#8230;</h4>\n",
